# MoonProof — Heloísa visual source, DESIGNER.mds and running screen contract
## Provenance / access
- **Requested source:** https://claude.ai/artifact/QV5ykVW5q9HvyZsH68SPf1, MoonProof screens A–H, two mobile references, V3 layers and educator/planner kits.
- Heloísa's user-shared screenshots are available in the conversation and used as the actual design reference; the shared Claude page presently displays **Sign in to see this artifact's data** to unauthenticated retrieval. Thus the **private system prompt/internal app sources cannot be extracted**. This is a faithful implementation from visible screens, not a claim to have copied hidden instructions.
- The original A–H, V3 and mobile specifications are mirrored as individual `*.designer.mds` files under this directory. They include boundaries: no fake scientific VAL, never reuse illustrative mockup numbers.
- Original author and repo source: @lisanogueira / PR #148, shared MoonProof core and 400 m/pixel LOLA DEM; independently reviewed backend series only later.

